{"id":"751fadd86ee607f2","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-pr-total.md","title":"fact-pr-total — Primitive Recursive Functions are Total","display":"fact-pr-total — Primitive Recursive Functions are Total","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-pr-total","aliases":["88-fact-pr-total"],"display":"fact-pr-total — Primitive Recursive Functions are Total","depends_on":["[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[88-df-defined]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-pr-total"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-pr-total</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-pr-total — Primitive Recursive Functions are Total"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate number-theoretic function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\\)</span> (arity-indexed primitive-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})\">\\(\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})\\)</span> (defined-at predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}total} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}total} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元原始递归函数谓词</li>\n<li>原始递归函数处处有定义</li>\n<li>区别于部分递归函数</li>\n<li>total性质来自构造方式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-defined","status":"resolved","id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-defined]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)$ (arity-indexed primitive-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-defined","status":"resolved","id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})$ (defined-at predicate, see [[88-df-defined]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec{x})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}total} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(f)\n\\to\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":977,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2f808bc294509a7d","7663d6a38dbde5cc"]}